{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约书亚记","commonName":"约书亚记","title":"约书亚记","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"9eb685769afd97937413dc8bd46c6ab5d21b53bc9e539bc2e909ca5de41a1ee6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":654},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["被击败的诸王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列人在约旦河东岸杀死了两个王，占据了他们的领土：自亚嫩谷直到黑门山，包括东面的整个亚拉巴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这两个王一个是住在希实本的亚摩利王西宏。他统辖的地区从亚嫩谷旁的亚罗珥，包括山谷中部和基列的一半，直到亚扪人边境的雅博河。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他的领土还包括约旦河谷东部：从加利利湖至亚拉巴海，也就是盐海，到伯·耶施末，直到毗斯迦的山麓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["另一个王是巴珊王噩，他原是利乏音的遗民，住在亚斯她录和以得来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他所统辖的地区包括黑门山、撒迦、整个巴珊，直到基述人和玛迦人的边境，还包括基列的另一半，直到希实本王西宏的国界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华的仆人摩西带领以色列人征服了这两个王，并把他们的土地分给吕便支派、迦得支派和玛拿西半个支派的人作产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["约书亚带领以色列人征服了约旦河西的诸王，占领的土地包括从黎巴嫩谷地的巴力·迦得直到西珥的哈拉山。约书亚按以色列的支派把这些土地分给以色列人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["那里有山区、丘陵、河谷、山坡、旷野和南地，就是赫人、亚摩利人、迦南人、比利洗人、希未人、耶布斯人住的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这些王是耶利哥王、伯特利附近的艾王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶路撒冷王、希伯仑王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶末王、拉吉王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["伊矶伦王、基色王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["底璧王、基德王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["何珥玛王、亚拉得王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["立拿王、亚杜兰王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["玛基大王、伯特利王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他普亚王、希弗王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["亚弗王、拉沙仑王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["玛顿王、夏琐王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["伸仑·米仑王、押煞王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["他纳王、米吉多王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["基低斯王、迦密附近的约念王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["多珥山上的多珥王、吉甲的戈印王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["得撒王，共三十一个王。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}